      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the upcoming (still in testing) Apple iOS version, I can see this being much more in handy since it would get quite annoying to manually toggle between PC, Android, and iOS toggles in your UdonGraph. Once again I assume you can use preprocessor directives to determine if you are building for PC, Android, or iOS.\n\nSomething like: IsUserOnAppleiOS\n\nThis is all assuming that an iOS build would be separate, if it's somehow converted for worlds (like shaders is a big question) then an iOS variant isn't necessary.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
